{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0000","name":"ARis","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"ARis","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":12,"damage":"6L Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Green","notes":"<p>Marks and tracks unauthorized decker icons. Each detected intruder raises Overwatch. Ability: Authenticate.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0001","name":"Authenticator","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Authenticator","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":12,"damage":"6L Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Green","notes":"<p>Validates access credentials at every node. Invalid users are flagged and locked out. Ability: Authenticate.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0002","name":"Looper","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Looper","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":12,"damage":"6M Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Green","notes":"<p>Traps decker icons in recursive data loops, disorienting navigation. Ability: Infiltration.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0003","name":"Mr. Medkit","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Mr. Medkit","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":10,"damage":"6L Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Green","notes":"<p>Repairs damage to other IC and patches security holes between passes. Ability: Guardian.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0004","name":"Scrambler","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Scrambler","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":15,"damage":"6M Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Green","notes":"<p>Scrambles and corrupts the decker's active programs, reducing their effectiveness. Ability: Erosion.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0005","name":"Blaster","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Blaster","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":18,"damage":"6S Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Hammers decker icons with heavy overload pulses. Can attack multiple targets simultaneously. Ability: Instance.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0006","name":"Crippler","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Crippler","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":18,"damage":"6M Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Systematically disables the decker's programs one by one. Abilities: Erosion, Corruption.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0007","name":"Dataworm","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Dataworm","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":20,"damage":"6S Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Bores into data structures, corrupting and destroying data on contact. Ability: Corrupt and Burn.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0008","name":"Gemini","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Gemini","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":20,"damage":"6M Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Splits into multiple instances to overwhelm deckers with simultaneous attacks. Ability: Instance.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0009","name":"Hydra","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Hydra","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":20,"damage":"6M Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Respawns from a hidden backup copy each time it is destroyed. Ability: Respawn.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0010","name":"Sparky","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Sparky","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":18,"damage":"6S Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Delivers intense electrical feedback through the Matrix connection. Particularly lethal in hot-sim VR. Ability: Instance.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0011","name":"Tar Baby","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Tar Baby","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":15,"damage":"6M Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Entraps decker icons, causing all their actions to cost extra Hacking Pool dice. Ability: Guardian.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0012","name":"Tracker","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Tracker","grading":"Gray","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":15,"damage":"6L Stun","hostSecurityTier":"Orange","notes":"<p>Traces decker icons to their physical location and marks them for Security response. Abilities: Authenticate, Infiltration.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/skull.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0013","name":"Killer","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Killer","grading":"Black","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":25,"damage":"6S","hostSecurityTier":"Red","notes":"<p>Elite lethal IC that delivers lethal biofeedback through the decker's neural interface. Deals physical damage in hot-sim VR.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/skull.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0014","name":"Ripper","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Ripper","grading":"Black","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":30,"damage":"6D","hostSecurityTier":"Red","notes":"<p>The most dangerous IC in existence. Tears through neural wetware as easily as code. Treat as kill-on-sight. Deals physical damage in hot-sim VR.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0015","name":"Alert (Passive)","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Scrambler","grading":"White","rating":4,"systemRating":4,"memoryRequired":100,"damage":"","hostSecurityTier":"Blue","notes":"<p><strong>Passive countermeasure.</strong> Detects unauthorized access and raises Overwatch by 1 per trigger. Alerts Security AI. Rating sets detection sensitivity. 100 Mp per instance.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0016","name":"Barrier (Passive)","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Scrambler","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":108,"damage":"","hostSecurityTier":"Blue","notes":"<p><strong>Passive countermeasure.</strong> Blocks pathways between nodes. Crossing requires Rating successes (Hacking + Hacking Pool vs System Rating). Memory: Rating squared x3 Mp.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0017","name":"Encryption (Passive)","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Authenticator","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":108,"damage":"","hostSecurityTier":"Blue","notes":"<p><strong>Passive countermeasure.</strong> Encrypts all data on this node. All actions against encrypted data add +Rating to the TN. Requires Decryption program to bypass without penalty. Memory: Rating squared x3 Mp.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0018","name":"Databomb (Passive)","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Scrambler","grading":"White","rating":6,"systemRating":6,"memoryRequired":144,"damage":"","hostSecurityTier":"Blue","notes":"<p><strong>Passive trap.</strong> Attached to a data file. On unauthorized access without Kill Switch program, self-deletes the protected file and triggers Alert. Memory: Rating squared x4 Mp.</p>","woundValue":0}}
{"img":"icons/svg/clockwork.svg","_id":"sr3e-ic-0019","name":"System Sweep (Passive)","type":"ic","system":{"icType":"Scrambler","grading":"White","rating":4,"systemRating":4,"memoryRequired":100,"damage":"","hostSecurityTier":"Blue","notes":"<p><strong>Passive countermeasure.</strong> Periodically scans for falsified marks and unauthorized users. Any detected access triggers Alert and raises Overwatch by 1. 100 Mp per instance.</p>","woundValue":0}}
